      "body": "## Motivation\r\n\r\ndLLM requests moved from `Scheduler.waiting_queue` into `dllm_manager.waiting_queue` could fall outside `SGLANG_REQ_WAITING_TIMEOUT` coverage before their first forward.\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n\r\n- Include pre-first-forward dLLM manager-held requests in waiting-timeout polling.\r\n- Preserve existing abort handling and rank-consistent cleanup behavior.\r\n- Add a focused regression covering a stale queued dLLM request and an already-denoising request.\r\n\r\n## Accuracy Tests\r\n\r\nN/A. This does not change model outputs.\r\n\r\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\r\n\r\nN/A. This is a scheduler timeout correctness fix.\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] Formatted with pre-commit\r\n- [x] Added unit test coverage\r\n- [x] Followed SGLang code style\r\n- [ ] Documentation update not needed\r\n- [ ] Accuracy/speed benchmarks not applicable\r\n\r\nRelated: #39499\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39272826459](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39272826459)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39272826396](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39272826396)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39272826411](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39272826411)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
